="1.0" data-id="1745564959162" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center" data-align="left"><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1743648677997" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1743648677997"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1743648677986" data-id="1743648677986"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743648711887" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1743648711887" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">植物由来の素材にこだわって作った</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">「肌掛け布団」</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">"KAPOK Sleep Ket"</h1></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743648705444" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1743648705444" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p><strong>「洗練されたデザイン性ながら、快適である」</strong></p><p><br></p><p>布団でそれを体現されているものは</p><p>少ないのではないでしょうか。</p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743648693629" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1743648693629" data-resolution="3000x3000" style=""><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/products/new-kapok-sleep-ket" target=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/a9836184-3780-4160-9430-51bcfd92aca6/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/KK_LINE%E3%83%AA%E3%83%83%E3%83%81%20_2_.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title="" width="1500" height="1012" natural-width="1500" natural-height="1012"></a></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743648841063" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1743648841063" style=""><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1 gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>一見、両立不可能に見える2つの特性を兼ね備えたアイテムを目指し、リバーシブルでもお使いいただける配色とデザインに落とし込んでいます。</p><p>リビングでパーティーを楽しむアクティブタイムにも、寝室でくつろぐリラックスタイムにも、どちらのシーンも快適に彩ってくれます。</p></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Separator" data-key="separator" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743655968031" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-separator" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1743655968031"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-align="left" data-exc=""><hr class="gf_separator"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1743649263008" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1743649263008"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1743649263070" data-id="1743649263070"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743649267591" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1743649267591"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center" data-gemlang="en"><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">"KAPOK Sleep Ket"が</h1><h1 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2">選ばれる理由</h1></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" data-atomgroup="row" id="r-1743649290528" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1743649290528"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1743648677986" data-id="1743648677986"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1743649290570" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="2" data-id="1